# Binary files

Files with binary content get a hex comparison.

```console
$ mydiff a.bin b.bin
? 1
--- a.bin
+++ b.bin
@@ 0x00000000 @@
-00000000  50 4e 47 00 01 02 68 65  6c 6c 6f 20 77 6f 72 6c  |PNG...hello worl|
+00000000  50 4e 47 00 01 02 68 65  6c 6c 6f 5f 77 6f 72 6c  |PNG...hello_worl|

$ mydiff -f summary a.bin b.bin
? 1
a.bin vs b.bin: binary, 1 differing byte(s), first at 0xb (sizes 19 vs 19)

$ mydiff a.bin a.bin

```
